/DefinitelyTyped","text":"The repository for high quality TypeScript type definitions.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"34864","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DOryL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA60CD93-6FF0-4A2B-88E6-8DAEDCE64152","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あと、JS書けるとTS書けるは別物だし、初心者向けならTSでわざわざチュートリアルの敷居を上げる必要性がないよね","ts":"1626606256.108200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ar1Xl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17c80434-94d9-4dc4-84ad-332bc55b5184","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TypeScript側がめっちゃ頑張ったのでReact+TypeScriptでやっていける状態(でいいのかな)","ts":"1626606240.107300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fxd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bd77d81-1eac-4102-8787-09cc66c1f405","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど。Reactなんもわからん状態です","ts":"1626606168.105800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iljoC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50e6d200-b9ea-4eda-be47-1588e1c58a98","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"顔本はFlow推しなので…","ts":"1626606124.105200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"796wc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8BE1FB5A-88A4-4D98-8FBB-BBC210DC6AED","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"公式チュートリアルがTSになることはないんじゃないかなw","ts":"1626606107.104900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OhgqE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c203f905-9df7-48e5-9143-103fb8920f91","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"Reactチュートリアルすすめてるけど、これまだデフォルトjavascriptのままなんですね","ts":"1626605718.104300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brbnH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0ac6eed-31d8-4f47-b4d2-3596782e4d1d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらくそうだと思います。。。 `write` と `on(function() { … })` があるオブジェクトを外からもらう。というルールにすればどうやって書き込むのかとかどうやってデータを json 化するかを隠蔽できそうですね。","ts":"1626544742.103600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sbL8z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e687a57a-941e-450e-b2cc-911a2ae5d8bb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ、だからこそこれだけ似てるようでちょっと違うライブラリが乱立しているのかもしれないですね…","ts":"1626537504.102300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nlCkM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"974d73dc-88a9-4397-8b7a-cae2fd30bb83","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"json が手に入ったあとのプロトコルですからねー。分離してみようかなぁ。","ts":"1626535896.101800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Obu/s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaa0960d-b510-424d-9219-8d696e9f514f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"汎用ではなくて LS 用！とかであればもちろんできる","ts":"1626535738.100600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BUoK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae314f57-d2a6-4489-92f9-340ab743f09e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"JSON-RPC の汎用ライブラリを作ろうと思ったら、そもそもストリームにはできないんですよね。ストリームから JSON を取り出す方法が決まってないから。その部分はユーザーに書かせるなり、別レイヤーに分離して提供するなりする必要がある","ts":"1626535710.100300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rcCG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9da20851-1752-4128-a94f-2cd8c9fd062b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうですね。json 自体をどう送受信するか？まで含んでいるので汎用とはいいにくいです。(vital-vs のモジュールもそうですね)","ts":"1626535060.099300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"09mXu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62fd0791-5b97-4bad-821c-f2ef6de45f25","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"てことはやっぱり vscode-jsonrpc は LS 専用ってことですよね。汎用の JSON-RPC ライブラリではない","ts":"1626534607.096000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yewj4"}]}]
